const title = "Rooms & Exits Chapter 2 Level 4 Walkthrough: Optical Store";
const description = "Rooms & Exits Chapter 2 Level 4 walkthrough for the Optical Store: the key on the eyewear shelf, the code 68459 in the locked glasses cabinet, the refractor lenses and the safe letters T-O-D, with real screenshots.";
const faqJsonLd = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the code in Rooms & Exits Chapter 2 Level 4 Optical Store?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "68459. The five digits are stamped on a small metal tag labelled Code, and that tag is sitting inside the locked eyewear cabinet that opens with the key from the display shelf. Type 68459 into the keypad on the wall plate and its drawer releases a refractor lens."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Where do I find the key for the glasses cabinet?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The key is lying on a glass shelf of the eyewear display wall in the main shop, next to the frames and marked with the usual sparkle. Tap it, open the inventory, select Key and press Use, then tap the frosted double doors of the tall cabinet on the left wall. The doors swing open onto six shelves of eyeglasses."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the safe code in the Optical Store?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "T-O-D, three letters, dialled on the letter wheel. You get them from the phoropter: once the four lens values sit on the right eyes the eye chart clears and a red rule underlines T, O and D. Turn the dial to T, then O, then D; the door swings open and a key is hanging inside."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What lens values does the phoropter need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The left eye wants 0.75 and -2.50 (they add to -1.75) and the right eye wants 1.75 and -1.25 (they add to 0.5). That is exactly what the prescription on the examiner's desk says: R 0.5 and L -1.75, with the working written on the paper as L = -2.5 + 0.75 = -1.75 and R = 1.75 - 1.25 = 0.5."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Where are the refractor lenses?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Two of them are pickups you cannot miss once the locks are open. The -1.25 lens is in the drawer that the 68459 keypad releases in the shop, and the -2.50 lens is in the drawer of the examiner's desk in the back room. Each one you bank adds its value to the phoropter's dials."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I finish the Optical Store level?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Take the key out of the open safe, go back into the shop, open the inventory, select Key and press Use, then tap the doorway on the left wall beside the tall display cabinet. The glowing exit icon appears, you tap it, and the level ends on LEVEL COMPLETED with +50 coins and a time of 4:14."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long is Chapter 2 Level 4?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The results screen in our recording reads 4:14. Nothing is timed and there is no fail state, so the only thing that stretches the room is walking past the key on the shelf or trying to open the safe with five digits instead of three letters."}}]};
